From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Demitri Nava <demitri@boltz.bio>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 09:04:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bes: report a target complete from its build and test
 records, once

The Bazel converter completed each target when its analysis ended. BuildBuddy
then showed a target as built before any of its actions ran, kept that result
when its build failed, and listed targets a BXL script only analysed as built.
A second final record could also replace a target's result.

Keep analysis as configuration only, and complete each target from its action
and test results, once, when the invocation is finalized. A command that ends
without an InvocationRecord is finalized when its stream closes.
